    // Third-party features batch 20 (2026-10-07): Colossal Summon — Summon Animal at 10 by a 20th-level caster: the animal Gargantuan in 6 by 6 squares, +20 feet to its Speeds,
    // Trample (or its dice note), Earth-Shatterer (its card casts Earthquake; again within the minute refused), Megalophobia (an enemy starting its turn in the aura saves:
    // frightened, then immune for an hour); the aura ends with the summon.
