    // Rank 7 batch 10: Entrancing Eyes (an emanation on the caster: a creature ending its turn inside saves — a critical success makes it immune to this casting,
    // so its next turn end brings no save; another critically fails: Stupefied 4, Fascinated and the Entranced note; the GM's focus control exposes a creature).
