    // Rank 3 batch 54: Overwhelming Memory — terrifying, failure: Frightened 1 and Stupefied 2; gleeful, success: the reactions note only;
    // tragic, critical failure: Dazzled and Stupefied 3; romantic, critical success: nothing.
