    // Rank 2 batch 78: Illusory Creature: a heightened (rank 3) cast allows a Huge image (rank 2 refuses it); the image's token has AC the spell DC and
    // saves DC − 10; its Strike hits a creature for 4d4 mental; that creature's Disbelieve heals half and its next hit deals nothing; the image
