    // Cantrip / rank 1 batch 82: Rainbow's End — the basic Fortitude save (1d4 spirit), Dazzled for 1 round on a failure (2 rounds at
    // 3rd rank), and the ally teleport as the caster's note Effect while Sustained (up to 1 minute), with the Heightened text at 3rd.
