    // Cantrip / rank 1 batch 140 (user decision): Pyroclastic Truth — the basic save; the damaged creature marked by fire; Fuel's persistent fire on
    // the marked only; the caster's Lethologic Mark (fire damage → Frightened 1; fire damage to 0 HP → dies), with the note on healing it.
